Subject: CPMS I03A Validator Dependency Activation Candidate Justification

@ [justification_uuid] 00a3b87f-7844-4213-bb7f-2cbc403bbed6

& [Need] CPMS-I03 requires one independent Draft 2020-12 observation that neither schemars generation nor typed serde can provide
& [SelectedCandidate] exact jsonschema 0.49.2 default-features false
  + exposes explicit Draft 2020-12 and embedded meta-schema behavior
  + removes HTTP file and TLS resolver capability at Cargo feature resolution
  + passed the bounded isolated debug probe over all five exact I02 documents
& [RejectedCandidate] Boon 0.6.1 for this slice
  + smaller graph is favorable
  + compiled default file-loader capability lacks feature-level removal
  + first debug build was denied before execution and no behavioral probe exists
& [OptionalFeature] protects default behavior and keeps validation absent unless explicitly selected
& [TestOnlyCheckpoint] proves dependency capability and host admission before production parser or validator architecture can depend on it
& [FourSurfaceLock] is the minimum sufficient change
  + workspace manifest owns exact common dependency policy
  + lock owns resolved checksums and transitive patches
  + tool manifest owns optional feature reachability
  + focused integration test owns all behavior proof without exporting API
& [RefusalReason] release host admission and dependency acceptance are incomplete
  + a documentation package can be complete while activation remains correctly refused
& [Decision] form an exact unsigned activation candidate and stop before dependency mutation
